    section.rt-school__content.rt-details
        .container
            .row
                .col-lg-4
                    .rt-blog__sidebar.d-none.d-lg-block
                        include ../../components/DetailsSidebar/toc
                        include ../../components/DetailsSidebar/form
                .col-lg-8
                    .rt-details__content
                        .d-block.d-lg-none
                            include ../../components/DetailsSidebar/toc

                        .post-content
                            h2 Giới thiệu trường Fort Erie International Academy
                            p
                                img.lazy(data-src="./images/blog/post-image.jpg" width="100%" alt="")
                            h3#heading_01 Administrative Team
                            p Ever dialled a number just to get an automated voice recording on the other end that leads nowhere? Not at Virtual High School! Our administrative team offers multiple ways for you to get in touch so that we can answer your questions promptly and knowledgeably:
                            ul
                                li Give us a call during office hours or leave us a voicemail. We've even got a toll-free number for added convenience if you're calling from outside of Canada.
                                li Send an email to information@virtualhighschool.com and we'll get you directed to the appropriate department.
                                li Message us on our website's live chat feature to get speedy replies.
                                li Hit us up on our social media platforms: Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn, and Twitter.
                                li If you're ever visiting the Bayfield area, feel free to pop by the school to say hello. We love meeting our students in person!
                            p
                                strong What kinds of things can our administrative team help you with? We're glad you asked!
                            ul 
                                li Fast course enrolment so you can begin within 24 hours
                                li Questions about our 70+ Ontario curriculum courses (including Fast Track and Upgrade options)
                                li Account troubleshooting and technical support
                                li VHS bursary and scholarship application assistance
                                li Communication with your high school or post-secondary institution
                                li Prompt midterm and final report processing
                                li Final exam preparation and organization
                            
                            h3#heading_02 Guidance Services
                            p It can be tricky to navigate your way through high school without skilled experts to help you along the way. Luckily, our guidance advisors are talented information wizards (still human, though) who know the Ontario Ministry of Education policies inside and out. Check out all of the guidance benefits you can receive at TOHS:
                            ul
                                li Give us a call during office hours or leave us a voicemail. We've even got a toll-free number for added convenience if you're calling from outside of Canada.
                                li Send an email to information@virtualhighschool.com and we'll get you directed to the appropriate department.
                                li Message us on our website's live chat feature to get speedy replies.
                                li Hit us up on our social media platforms: Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn, and Twitter.
                                li If you're ever visiting the Bayfield area, feel free to pop by the school to say hello. We love meeting our students in person!

                            p
                                img.lazy(data-src="./images/blog/post-image.jpg" width="100%" alt="")
                            .wp-caption-text Many different activities encouraged them to explore and discover where their interests lie.

                            h3#heading_03 Teachers
                            p The teachers at Virtual High School are definitely humans on the surface, but we suspect they might be superheroes too! Our world-class teachers are all certified and exceptionally talented in their subject areas. What do TOHS teachers do?
                            ul 
                                li Answer your questions and explain the trickiest of concepts.
                                li Grade your assessments with speed and precision. (Psst—try a Fast Track course for 2-day grading!)
                                li Provide detailed feedback so that you can improve.
                                li Help you reach your post-secondary application deadlines.

                            blockquote.wp-block-quote
                                p As educators and cool people, we believe in helping each other whenever we can. Your success is our priority, and sometimes you may find that you need a little extra support in your courses. Enter our Student Academic Support team!

                            h3#heading_04 Student Academic Support
                            p Ever dialled a number just to get an automated voice recording on the other end that leads nowhere? Not at Virtual High School! Our administrative team offers multiple ways for you to get in touch so that we can answer your questions promptly and knowledgeably:
                            ul
                                li Give us a call during office hours or leave us a voicemail. We've even got a toll-free number for added convenience if you're calling from outside of Canada.
                                li Send an email to information@virtualhighschool.com and we'll get you directed to the appropriate department.
                                li Message us on our website's live chat feature to get speedy replies.
                                li Hit us up on our social media platforms: Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn, and Twitter.
                                li If you're ever visiting the Bayfield area, feel free to pop by the school to say hello. We love meeting our students in person!
                            
                            h3#heading_05 School Community
                            p We're also dedicated to ensuring that our students can make new friends and pursue different hobbies no matter where they are in the world! Our community activities aim to get students chatting about the people, places, and interests that make up their lives outside of the classroom.
                            ul
                                li Learn about diverse cultures at a Meet-and-Greet.
                                li Join the student book club.
                                li Participate in our social media photo series and pop quizzes.
                                li Sit in on sample first-year lectures from some of Canada's top universities.
                                li Test your knowledge at our trivia competitions.
                                li Attend virtual field trips and presentations at art galleries and museums.

                    .col-12.d-block.d-lg-none
                        include ../../components/DetailsSidebar/form